---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	title="Coins, Dice & Playing Cards | Probability | Class 10 | The Concepts Adda"
	description="Master sample spaces for coin tosses, pair of dice (36 outcomes), and full 52 playing cards suit & face card breakdown for Class 10 NCERT Mathematics."
>
	<main class="lesson-page">
		<div class="lesson-container">
			<a href="/probability" class="back-link">
				<span class="back-arrow">←</span>
				<span>Back to Probability</span>
			</a>

			<!-- LESSON HEADER -->
			<section class="lesson-header">
				<div class="lesson-number">02</div>
				<div class="lesson-header-copy">
					<div class="lesson-label">LESSON 02 · CLASS 10 MATHEMATICS (NCERT)</div>
					<h1>Coins, Dice & <span>Playing Cards</span></h1>
					<p>
						Master sample spaces for 1, 2, and 3 coin tosses, 2-dice rolls (36 outcomes), and the 52 playing cards distribution.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CONTENT LAYOUT -->
			<section class="content-layout">
				<article class="lesson-content">

					<!-- 01 · COINS -->
					<div class="topic-label">01 · COIN TOSSES</div>
					<h2>Sample Space of Coin Experiments</h2>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>1 Coin (2¹)</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>1 Coin Toss</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">Sample Space <strong>S = &lbrace;H, T&rbrace;</strong> (Total 2 outcomes).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>2 Coins (2²)</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>2 Coins Tossed Together</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">Sample Space <strong>S = &lbrace;(H,H), (H,T), (T,H), (T,T)&rbrace;</strong> (Total 4 outcomes).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>3 Coins (2³)</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>3 Coins Tossed Together</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">Sample Space <strong>S = &lbrace;HHH, HHT, HTH, HTT, THH, THT, TTH, TTT&rbrace;</strong> (Total 8 outcomes).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 02 · DICE -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">02 · DICE EXPERIMENTS</div>
					<h2>Pair of Dice (36 Outcomes)</h2>

					<p>
						When two standard 6-sided dice are thrown simultaneously, the total number of possible outcomes is <strong>6 × 6 = 36</strong>:
					</p>

					<div class="calc-box">
						(1,1) (1,2) (1,3) (1,4) (1,5) (1,6)<br/>
						(2,1) (2,2) (2,3) (2,4) (2,5) (2,6)<br/>
						(3,1) (3,2) (3,3) (3,4) (3,5) (3,6)<br/>
						(4,1) (4,2) (4,3) (4,4) (4,5) (4,6)<br/>
						(5,1) (5,2) (5,3) (5,4) (5,5) (5,6)<br/>
						(6,1) (6,2) (6,3) (6,4) (6,5) (6,6)
					</div>

					<!-- 03 · PLAYING CARDS -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">03 · PLAYING CARDS</div>
					<h2>Deck of 52 Playing Cards Breakdown</h2>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span style="background:#fee2e2; color:#dc2626;">26 Red Cards</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>Red Suits (26 Cards)</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">13 Hearts ♥ and 13 Diamonds ♦.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span style="background:#f1f5f9; color:#0f172a;">26 Black Cards</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>Black Suits (26 Cards)</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">13 Spades ♠ and 13 Clubs ♣.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>12 Face Cards</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>Face Cards (Jacks, Queens, Kings)</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">4 Jacks (J), 4 Queens (Q), 4 Kings (K) = <strong>12 Face Cards</strong> total.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>4 Aces</span>
							<div>
								<p><strong>Ace Cards</strong></p>
								<span style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px;">4 Aces (1 per suit: Spades, Clubs, Hearts, Diamonds).</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 04 · SOLVED NCERT EXAMPLE -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">04 · SOLVED NCERT EXAMPLE</div>
					<h2>Step-by-Step Problem Solving</h2>

					<div class="example-card">
						<div class="example-header">
							<span class="example-badge">EXAMPLE 1</span>
							<h3>One card is drawn from a well-shuffled deck of 52 cards. Find the probability of getting: (i) a king of red color, (ii) a face card.</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="example-solution">
							<p>Total possible outcomes = <strong>52</strong>.</p>

							<p style="margin-top:10px;"><strong>(i) King of Red Color</strong>:</p>
							<p>Red suits are Hearts and Diamonds. Each has 1 king ⟹ Favorable outcomes = <strong>2</strong> (King of Hearts & King of Diamonds).</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								P(Red King) = 2 / 52 = <strong>1 / 26</strong>
							</div>

							<p style="margin-top:14px;"><strong>(ii) A Face Card</strong>:</p>
							<p>Total face cards = 4 Jacks + 4 Queens + 4 Kings = <strong>12</strong>.</p>
							<div class="calc-box">
								P(Face Card) = 12 / 52 = <strong>3 / 13</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 05 · QUICK SUMMARY -->
					<div class="topic-label second-label">05 · QUICK SUMMARY</div>
					<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>

					<div class="summary-list">
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>01</span>
							<p>2 dice rolled together generate <strong>36 outcomes</strong>.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>02</span>
							<p>52 cards deck = <strong>26 Red + 26 Black</strong>.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="summary-item">
							<span>03</span>
							<p>There are exactly <strong>12 face cards</strong> and <strong>4 aces</strong> in a deck.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- LESSON NAVIGATION -->
					<div class="lesson-navigation">
						<a href="/probability/theoretical-probability" class="previous-lesson">
							<span>←</span>
							<div>
								<small>PREVIOUS LESSON</small>
								<strong>Theoretical Probability</strong>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/probability/applications-and-practice" class="next-lesson">
							<div>
								<small>NEXT LESSON</small>
								<strong>Applications & Practice</strong>
							</div>
							<span>→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- SIDEBAR -->
				<aside class="lesson-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<div class="sidebar-title">PROBABILITY</div>
						<div class="progress-text">Lesson 02 of 03</div>
						<div class="progress-bar">
							<div style="width: 66.6%;"></div>
						</div>

						<div class="sidebar-lessons">
							<a href="/probability/theoretical-probability" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>01</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Theoretical Probability</strong>
									<small>P(E) & P(E) + P(Ē) = 1</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/probability/coins-dice-cards" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>02</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Coins, Dice & Cards</strong>
									<small>Sample spaces & 52 cards</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/probability/applications-and-practice" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>03</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Applications & Practice</strong>
									<small>NCERT word problems</small>
								</div>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<style>
		.lesson-page {
			min-height: 100vh;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #ffffff 35%, #f7f9fc 100%);
			color: #14213d;
			padding: 45px 0 100px;
		}

		.lesson-container {
			width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
			margin: 0 auto;
		}

		.back-link {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 7px;
			color: #667085;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-size: 14px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 35px;
			transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
		}

		.back-link:hover {
			color: #2563eb;
			transform: translateX(-3px);
		}

		.lesson-header {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: 25px;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 40px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 24px;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
			box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.055);
			margin-bottom: 45px;
		}

		.lesson-number {
			width: 80px;
			height: 80px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			border-radius: 20px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 23px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 850;
			letter-spacing: 1.7px;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 54px);
			line-height: 1.05;
			letter-spacing: -2px;
			font-weight: 900;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.lesson-header h1 span {
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.lesson-header p {
			margin: 15px 0 0;
			max-width: 720px;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 17px;
			line-height: 1.65;
		}

		.content-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
			gap: 45px;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.lesson-content {
			min-width: 0;
			padding: 5px 0 0;
		}

		.topic-label {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.8px;
			margin-bottom: 14px;
		}

		.second-label {
			margin-top: 60px;
		}

		.lesson-content h2 {
			margin: 0;
			color: #14213d;
			font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 38px);
			line-height: 1.1;
			letter-spacing: -1.5px;
			font-weight: 900;
		}

		.lesson-content > p {
			max-width: 780px;
			margin: 18px 0 0;
			color: #687180;
			font-size: 16.5px;
			line-height: 1.75;
		}

		.formula-box {
			margin-top: 22px;
			padding: 24px 28px;
			border-radius: 20px;
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
			color: #ffffff;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.formula-box strong {
			font-size: 18px;
			color: #38bdf8;
			font-weight: 700;
			line-height: 1.5;
		}

		.example-card {
			margin-top: 25px;
			border-radius: 20px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.035);
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		.example-header {
			padding: 20px 24px;
			background: #f8fafc;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
		}

		.example-badge {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 4px 12px;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #2563eb;
			color: #ffffff;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.example-header h3 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 18px;
			font-weight: 800;
			color: #14213d;
		}

		.example-solution {
			padding: 24px;
			color: #475569;
			font-size: 15px;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.calc-box {
			margin-top: 10px;
			padding: 14px 18px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			background: #0f172a;
			color: #38bdf8;
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
		}

		.summary-list {
			display: grid;
			gap: 16px;
			margin-top: 26px;
		}

		.summary-item {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			padding: 20px 24px;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.03);
		}

		.summary-item span {
			padding: 8px 14px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #eef4ff;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 900;
			font-size: 13px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}

		.summary-item p {
			margin: 0;
			color: #334155;
			font-size: 15.5px;
			line-height: 1.5;
			font-weight: 600;
		}

		.lesson-navigation {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 20px;
			margin-top: 60px;
			padding-top: 40px;
			border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		}

		.previous-lesson,
		.next-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 16px;
			padding: 18px 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: #ffffff;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #14213d;
			transition: all 0.2s ease;
		}

		.next-lesson {
			margin-left: auto;
			text-align: right;
			justify-content: flex-end;
		}

		.previous-lesson:hover,
		.next-lesson:hover {
			border-color: #2563eb;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		.previous-lesson div,
		.next-lesson div {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.previous-lesson small,
		.next-lesson small {
			display: block;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			margin-bottom: 4px;
		}

		.previous-lesson strong,
		.next-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 15px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #0f172a;
		}

		.previous-lesson span,
		.next-lesson span {
			font-size: 20px;
			color: #2563eb;
			font-weight: 800;
		}

		.lesson-sidebar {
			position: sticky;
			top: 30px;
		}

		.sidebar-card {
			padding: 28px;
			border-radius: 24px;
			border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.04);
		}

		.sidebar-title {
			color: #2563eb;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 900;
			letter-spacing: 1.5px;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.progress-text {
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 12px;
		}

		.progress-bar {
			height: 6px;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: #e2e8f0;
			overflow: hidden;
			margin-bottom: 24px;
		}

		.progress-bar div {
			height: 100%;
			background: #2563eb;
			border-radius: 10px;
		}

		.sidebar-lessons {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson {
			display: flex;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 12px;
			padding: 12px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #334155;
			transition: background 0.15s ease;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson:hover {
			background: #f8fafc;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active {
			background: #eef4ff;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson > span {
			width: 24px;
			height: 24px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: #f1f5f9;
			color: #64748b;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active > span {
			background: #dbeafe;
			color: #2563eb;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson div {
			min-width: 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #1e293b;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active strong {
			color: #1d4ed8;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson small {
			display: block;
			font-size: 11px;
			color: #64748b;
			margin-top: 3px;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		.sidebar-lesson.active small {
			color: #3b82f6;
		}

		@media (max-width: 900px) {
			.content-layout {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.lesson-header {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				padding: 28px;
			}

			.lesson-number {
				width: 60px;
				height: 60px;
				font-size: 18px;
			}

			.lesson-navigation {
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.next-lesson {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
